"""Finite native undertakings. Each row describes a concrete playable situation."""
# title | client | location | recommended level | badge rank (0 = personal) | fee | outcome | scene and alternatives
JOBS = "\nAkitsuhara Guild: Something in the Flour|Shin Watarai|Bamboo Crossing|1|1|30|Clear the two granary rats from the stall store and close the chewed vent so food can be kept safely.|Shin has balanced lunch supplies on a stool. One rat is exposed and the other behind shelving. A lure, trap or ordinary fight works; no rat king or disease sequel. They are level 1–2 weak nuisances, one active hostile at a time.\nAkitsuhara Guild: The Wandering Sandals|Yae Mizuno|Blackpine Posthouse|2|1|35|Recover the three displaced pairs of guest sandals and stop the little roadside imp from taking more.|A Roadside Sparrow Imp has made a nest under the parcel bench. A shiny scrap, a negotiated trade or driving it away can work. The guests' footwear is not loot.\nAkitsuhara Guild: A Wheel Before Supper|Kentarō Maeba|Rainsong Mill|2|1|40|Clear the wheel obstruction and safely restore the mill’s ordinary operation.|A branch and one Paddy Mudling occupy the lower channel. Bypass, lure or remove them, then check the bearing. Earth, Water and mundane leverage are useful; no affinity is required.\nAkitsuhara Guild: Bees at the Wrong Door|Kenji Morita|Goldfinch Orchard|3|1|45|Move the displaced hive to the prepared orchard stand without leaving the shared path dangerous.|The hive is valuable property. Smoke, patient handling, a trained helper or suitable magic can solve it. Killing every bee destroys the agreed asset rather than automatically winning.\nAkitsuhara Guild: Cloth on the Forest Road|Aya Takino|Woodland Dye Workshop|3|1|40|Recover the real cloth consignment from the overturned pack cart and deliver it dry enough for its intended use.|A loose wheel and a sudden shower left the small cart tilted beside the forest path. Secure the load, repair or lighten the cart, or arrange willing porters. A torn bundle is a negotiable partial result; this is a practical recovery, not a pirate attack.\nAkitsuhara Guild: The Gate That Squeaks|Takuro Namiki|Terrace Waterworks|4|1|55|Restore the jammed lower sluice and leave an agreed safe flow to both adjacent fields.|A broken peg and a trivial mudling explain the problem. Two farmers want different flows. A clear compromise is enough; no court trial is mandatory.\nAkitsuhara Guild: Little Ashes|Shunji Dobashi|Basalt Kilns|5|1|65|Remove the three small Kiln Ashlings from the cooling walk and leave the next firing safe.|The ash creatures are attracted to hot waste, not malicious apprentices. Move or cool the waste, contain them or fight one at a time. No explosive hidden elite.\nAkitsuhara Guild: Missing on the Ridge|Yumi Sawatari|Mirror-Reed Bridge|7|1|90|Find the overdue trail helper and bring the helper and the accompanied travelers back to a usable woodland route.|A turned ankle and an Antler-Moss Boar occupying the lower bend have stranded a trail party at a dry shelter. A supported walk, a distraction, an alternate marked path or a proportionate fight can work. The helper is alive unless actual events change that.\nAkitsuhara Guild: Paper with Teeth|Mitsue Harada|Green Thread Paperworks|7|1|95|Stop the Paper-Face Moths eating the drying sheets and protect the remaining order.|Three moths occupy different drying bays. Covering the pulp, attracting them to waste sheets or a controlled fight works. An open flame can damage the goods.\nAkitsuhara Guild: The Mine Brace|Ruri Nabatame|Amber-Salt Mine|8|1|110|Inspect the accessible junction and make the agreed working face safe from the discovered centipede and failed brace.|A Crystal Centipede has followed mineral seepage. Support the actual load before disturbing it. A specialist, bait or blocked side tunnel can avoid a direct battle.\nAkitsuhara Guild: Unwelcome at the Orchard|Mutsumi Hosaka|Hoshina Village|8|1|100|Stop the antler-moss boar damaging the village’s marked growing plots.|One ordinary animal uses a broken fence gap. Repair, diversion and relocation are possible. Respect its actual resolved state; no larger parent appears as a compulsory second hunt.\nAkitsuhara Guild: A Mask Too Many|Kinu Amakusa|Paper Moon Pavilion|10|1|130|Locate the moving mask and make the pavilion’s storage safe for its agreed rehearsal.|A Paper-Face Lurker animates borrowed props to seek an audience. A contained performance, restitution or dispersal works if it actually stops attacking handlers. No possession of the whole theater.\nAkitsuhara Guild: Charcoal under Watch|Mina Kurusu|Bamboo Charcoal Camp|12|1|150|Escort the agreed charcoal load through the disputed stretch without losing people or cargo.|Two opportunists want road dues and bluff more readily than they fight. Bargaining, evidence of payment, an alternate maintained route or defeating them are options. One payment is not a permanent safe-conduct for every future caravan.\nAkitsuhara Guild: The Bent Boundary|Kazuma Ebisawa|Blackpine Boundary Stones|14|1|175|Establish the moved markers’ original positions and carry out the agreed safe restoration.|Fresh drag marks and a surviving survey notch matter more than an impressive speech. A Boundary Tengu objects to careless work but can accept an accurately restored line. Do not make its first accusation automatically true.\nAkitsuhara Guild: What the Bridge Carries|Rika Ogata|South River Bridge|15|1|190|Inspect the damaged bridge section and reopen the stated lane safely for ordinary loads.|A contractor supplied a thinner beam than the invoice claimed. Secure the crossing before pursuing blame. Replacement, a sound temporary brace or restricted use can fulfill the accepted scope.\nAkitsuhara Guild: Across the Rime|Sana Kuroiwa|Rime Bridge|18|2|230|Get the agreed supply caravan across the bridge and into Snowcedar Refuge with its people and essential stores.|Weather, footing and one territorial snow-mantle tengu matter. Waiting, a negotiated pause or a prepared escort can succeed. Do not silently skip the actual crossing or turn the refuge into hostile ground.\nAkitsuhara Guild: The Hollow Shrine Cups|Yukina Tsuribe|Hollow Cedar Ruins|20|2|270|Recover the named memorial cups and stop the ruined shrine’s current dangerous manifestation.|A Cinder Umbrella has arranged the cups around a smoldering old offering. Handling the actual grievance, removing its fuel or defeating it can work. The cups belong to the shrine.\nAkitsuhara Guild: More Than Footprints|Takane Shibata|White Antler Basin|22|2|300|Determine the cause of the missing porters’ trail and recover the surviving travelers or trustworthy evidence of their fate.|Snowburrow Mukade disturbed the camp from below. Careful shelter work and tracking can rescue the porters without chasing the creature into its deepest tunnel. No automatic death merely because the player took time to prepare.\nAkitsuhara Guild: A Mirror Gone Dark|Rei Tsunemori|Broken Relay Tower|25|2|340|Restore one safe signal line and secure the relay against its current occupant.|A Storm-Kite Tengu nests among damaged reflectors. It wants the shiny pieces, not a national war. Give it a viable alternative, exclude it or defeat it, then actually test the chosen line.\nAkitsuhara Guild: Beneath the Splitshaft|Osamu Kariya|Abandoned Splitshaft|28|2|390|Map the accessible lower cavity and bring back the agreed observations and sample without abandoning a participating worker.|The sample lies near a Stone-Eating Centipede route. A braced observation point, decoy mineral or prepared fight can work. Deeper passages are optional and not part of the fee.\nAkitsuhara Guild: A Banner Still Standing|Ayame Kagetsuna|Forgotten Muster Camp|30|2|450|Recover the disputed unit banner and settle the camp’s current threat enough for a safe withdrawal.|Hollow War Armor repeats an old defensive formation. Orders found in the actual camp, separation of the frames or combat can open a route. The dead unit’s history is not proof of a present house conspiracy.\nAkitsuhara Guild: A Shape above the Roots|Asa Kogure|Rootfall Ravine|32|2|500|Identify the root-back predator’s occupied route and make the commissioned lower walk safe.|A Root-Back Nue hunts from the overhead roots. Block its approach, relocate its bait or defeat it. The upper path remains a retreat; it does not seal itself behind the party.\nAkitsuhara Guild: Ice That Listens|Yoriko Abe|Sleeping Lake Cavern|38|3|650|Complete the posted cavern survey and secure the measured approach against the Ice-Reed Serpent.|The serpent senses floor vibration. Rope-supported movement and a controlled distraction can prevent an unnecessary fight. A serious direct battle is a knowingly chosen risk.\nAkitsuhara Guild: Hagire among the Cedars|Asa Kogure|Lanternwood Field Shelter|38|3|800|End Hagire’s attacks on the commissioned lower cedar route through genuine defeat or a carried-out exclusion that she cannot immediately bypass.|Hagire is level 42, hostile and physically dangerous. Torn strips and snapping joints warn before her reach does. Her three haunts are Ragged Cedar Hollow, Old Mask Trail and Foxfire Verge. Investigation can reveal narrow low crossings that restrict her contorted lunges. Ordinary pleading does not tame her; retreat and a prepared party are sensible. A real defeat or effective exclusion ends this finite contract. Merely reaching a hollow or surviving a glance does not.\nA Bell for the Mist|Sae Kagurazaka|Evening Maple Shrine|3|0|0|Recover the way bell’s dropped clapper from the shallow mooring steps and help Sae Kagurazaka restore the bell.|The clapper is visible below River Lantern Mooring - Cargo Steps. A pole, rope loop, careful wading or a suitable cantrip works. No rare drop, dangerous hunt or tournament is required. Sae supplies the bell body and shows the safe Moonless Torii approach after the actual repair. The route is earned through this short local help, not an examination.\nThe Cost of a Courtyard|Naoe Futami|Canal Ward Homes|12|0|120|Resolve the immediate coercive claim on Naoe Futami’s workshop through a real withdrawn demand, sound legal ruling or negotiated settlement she accepts.|The signed threat letters and a false debt entry can be checked at the magistracy. Exposing the coercion can cost Shigure Tsubakiri an ally. A fight is not automatically a legal transfer. Naoe wants her home, not a compulsory revenge campaign.\nOne Honest Demonstration|Hatsu Kanesue|Ginkgo Crossbow Works|18|0|180|Complete a truthful controlled assessment of the commissioned crossbow’s heating fault and deliver the findings to the consenting client.|Test with real bolts and a safe backstop, inspect the feed and allow cooling. Concealing the defect can favor Shigure but is a different, explicitly dishonest outcome. Ordinary crossbows remain useful; the device is not a gun.\nThe Ledger and the Soup|Katsuho Enoki|Broken Kite Camp|20|0|220|Resolve the particular stolen caravan consignment through actual return or a settlement accepted by its owner.|Katsuho wants out but also wants to keep the profit. Copies of his accounts may support exposure, leverage or a voluntary restitution. Killing a random bandit does not return the named cargo. No forced recruitment or automatic moral conversion.\nA Patient Distance|Chinatsu Hanegi|Morning Crane Dojo|1|0|0|Take part in a genuine first practice and demonstrate one safe attack, stop or retreat suited to actual training.|A sincere unsuccessful attempt is useful participation. No duel against an expert, free mastery or mandatory weapon change. Chinatsu explains a correction and gives one manageable next exercise.\nThe Message behind the Message|Yuzuri Kageura|Hidden Reed Training Ground|2|0|35|Complete the agreed local observation exercise and give a truthful account of what was actually noticed.|The task is to identify which practice porter altered a marked load, not steal real letters or trespass into a house. Observation, questions and practical tests work. Do not invent a hidden assassin to validate the exercise.\nAn Escort in Plain Clothes|Ayame Kagetsuna|South Gate Caravan Yard|3|0|55|Accompany the agreed short local delivery and resolve its immediate safe-arrival problem without treating bystanders as enemies.|A wheel catches at the outer yard and a proud porter refuses help. This is a modest practical duty. A blade, magic or household name does not replace asking before handling someone’s goods.\nFirst Bread in Hoshina|Mutsumi Hosaka|Hoshina Village|1|0|30|Help finish the agreed communal oven preparations and meet the neighbor receiving the first basket.|A jammed vent, wet kindling and a missing paddle offer ordinary choices. Practical help, asking the right person or a modest cantrip works. No hidden disaster or automatic ownership of a cottage.\nThe Bow That Will Not Settle|Eri Tamura|East Wind Archery Hall|7|0|60|Identify the actual practice bow fault and help its owner arrange a workable repair or replacement.|A twist in the string, not a curse, spoils the shot. The owner’s pride complicates the conversation. No need to humiliate the pupil or demonstrate a master-level shot.\nThe Oven and the Boundary|Sachi Morisawa|Cedarfall Hamlet|4|0|45|Carry out an agreement that lets the communal oven operate without damaging the neighbor’s newly planted bed.|Heat, drainage and foot traffic each affect the problem. Moving one working surface or laying a path can solve it. Neither neighbor is secretly a yokai.\nThe Archive Has Two Dates|Naohiro Umemoto|Ancestor Archive|12|0|100|Establish which of the two actual repair dates belongs to the disputed bridge and deliver a supported account.|A copied number and a surviving carpenter’s mark disagree. Check the physical evidence and witnesses rather than trusting a confident house advocate. Do not invent the world's hidden origins in a genealogy record.\nThe Last Dry Platform|Oroha|Crane-of-the-Hush Crossing|22|0|200|Recover the missing route marker and restore the actual raised path to Bellroot Refuge without leaving a traveler stranded.|A Mist-Lure Wisp mimics a familiar call beyond a broken root. The marker is lodged on a real branch, not in a dream. A tether, accurate response to the echo or a fight can recover it. Oroha’s agreement is limited and does not grant control of the realm.\nThe Name on the Parcel|Haru Tomisaka|Blackpine Posthouse|20|0|180|Recover the real addressed message lost on Ashen Festival Road and return it or deliver it with the recipient’s consent.|An Empty Festival Husk repeats its opening line, confusing a name with an invitation. The sealed letter is a mundane belonging, not the player's stolen memory. Questions, trade or a careful retrieval can succeed. Respect the recipient’s privacy.\nExpedition: The Bamboo Method|Akihisa Manabe|Shiun Pilgrim Lodge|10|0|180|Complete the agreed Akitsuhara field comparison with willing local practitioners and return the actual observations to the sponsoring instructor.|Compare a practiced movement and a stated analytical account without declaring either inherently superior. A nonmage can record, question, measure or organize a demonstration. Consent and an honest record matter; tourism or a single display is insufficient.\nExpedition: Amber without the Mine|Léonie Vauclair|Quarry Exchange|18|2|280|Collect the agreed naturally exposed amber-salt samples and observations on the marked Thundercrag route, then deliver them to the buyer.|This is a foreign field commission available through the capital or Glowhaven guild. It authorizes the named exposed site, not trespass into a working mine. A prepared escort or hired specialist is valid.\nExpedition: A Crossbow in the Rain|Jin Lin|Koganedai Guesthouse|20|2|320|Complete the agreed field trial of a real loaned mechanism and return it with truthful performance notes.|Humidity and one practical target exercise matter. The client retains ownership. A failed trial can still yield the agreed research if it was conducted safely and honestly; it does not give a free prototype.\nExpedition: Snowmelt Letters|Hiyori Mitsuba|Adventurer's Guild - Benitsuru Branch|25|2|400|Carry the agreed specimen exchange to Drakenspire, complete the stated observation and return a truthful field record.|Use actual portal permission and the existing Whitepass Caravan Lodge and its routes. This is optional foreign fieldwork, not the cancelled level-twenty field test or an excuse to move the party without consent.\nExpedition: Reeds above the Clouds|Hiyori Mitsuba|Adventurer's Guild - Benitsuru Branch|25|2|400|Complete the agreed Asterveil reed comparison at Mirrorwater Basin and return the actual samples or an accepted in-place record.|Obtain route permission and a feasible crossing with local help. Do not endanger Suzuha Midorise or appropriate her thesis. A noncaster can make valuable observations and hire a specialist.\nExpedition: The Foreign Grain|Komugi Hanabishi|Adventurer's Guild - Glowhaven Branch|12|1|220|Complete the commissioned comparison of Akitsuhara’s ordinary irrigation plots and deliver usable observations to the Glowhaven client.|The work takes place at Low Meadow Paddies with permission. It is a genuine journey beyond Glowhaven. Owners can consent to observations without yielding crops or land; portal access remains separately arranged.\nExpedition: A Reed Bell's Answer|Dōgen Hanamori|Cloudbell Monastery|20|0|220|Study a consenting spirit-side response at the opened local torii route and deliver a careful account that distinguishes observation from speculation.|The small Veiled Beyond is reached through the earned Soul Torii, not an invented portal. The threshold is a valid limited observation site. Going deeper is a separate deliberate choice, not required by the contract.\nAkitsuhara Guild: The Collector's Hearing|Jirō Hozumi|Benitsuru Magistracy|24|2|360|Bring Renga Itsuzaki to the agreed lawful hearing alive, or obtain her genuine voluntary attendance with the evidence preserved.|This commission concerns actual road robbery supported by witness accounts, not her ancestry or an insulting conversation. A negotiated appearance, documented surrender or safe capture works. Killing her does not fulfill this capture contract. Her crew may bargain, obstruct or abandon her according to actual events.\nAn Unmarked Parcel|Kohina Beppu|Goldleaf Arcade|15|0|160|Carry out the specific discreet delivery agreed with Kohina Beppu, or resolve its exposed ownership dispute on terms the actual parties accept.|The parcel contains fittings stripped from a debtor’s boat without a lawful seizure. The player may ask to inspect, refuse, return the goods, expose the claim or knowingly deliver them. Do not convert the player’s refusal into acceptance or pay twice for incompatible resolutions.\nThe Wrong Water Seal|Hiroto Sakuma|Mizuhara Castle|16|0|170|Resolve the particular forged exemption claim without leaving a false entry imposed on an uninvolved household.|Hiroto accepted a favor and now wants a quietly altered copy. The actual original, the payer and the affected grower permit several choices. Helping him conceal it is a conscious dishonest approach, not secretly the morally correct path. Exposure or an agreed correction can settle the same immediate undertaking.\n"


ARCS = [
 dict(id='oni_imported_edge',title='The Price of a New Edge',theme='A few imported magitech weapons alter who can threaten whom. Naoe Futami, Hatsu Kanesue, Shigure Tsubakiri and Kureha Tsubakiri have concrete overlapping interests beyond this story. Develop investigation, demonstration and bargaining through the capital and eastern works. The extraordinary articulated prototype is real, finite and guarded. No guns.',surfacePremise='Naoe Futami has received coercive land demands while Shigure Tsubakiri quietly acquires space and mechanisms for a private weapon project',expectedConclusion='The immediate coercive project is exposed, constrained through a workable agreement, appropriated at a real cost, dismantled or successfully supported by the player. Record the workshop residents’ actual outcomes and the prototype’s real owner and condition. Do not force a coup, assassination or national civil war. A complete local settlement ends this arc; subsequent work remains optional.',minQuestsForConclusion=2,status='active',secrets=['Shigure has hidden an articulated polearm whose crystal feed overheats during long deployment. Hatsu knows the defect but not every political plan.','Kureha wants bargaining power and may sacrifice her brother’s scheme to retain legitimate investment. She is neither omniscient nor automatically innocent.']),
 dict(id='oni_veiled_paths',title='Where the Fog Answers',theme='The Veiled Beyond is a fog-shrouded living wilderness with unsettling mythic scale, deceptive calls and indifferent or dangerous spirits. Keep a reliable return torii and discoverable physical paths. The short bell-repair access quest stays accessible; deeper investigation is optional.',surfacePremise='the restored way bell can answer the quiet stone torii near Lanternwood, where an old path vanishes into dense mist',expectedConclusion='Conclude a chosen bounded investigation by restoring a refuge path, recovering the real message or making an actual agreement with Oroha. Preserve discoveries, spirit attitudes and actual property. Do not require conquering the realm, erasing player memories or closing the home route.',minQuestsForConclusion=2,status='active',secrets=['Some voices are living mimics; others are repeated impressions. Familiar sound alone does not prove a familiar person is present.','Oroha knows its crossing and has its own pride and limits. It is not a universal guide or a free familiar.'])
]
